      "id": "claim_0667f96f796f44cfa2894b7174de500b",
      "statement": "Send failures are classified retryable, permanent, or stopped; retryable errors are retried up to send_max_retries inside the job while permanent errors short-circuit, and send_verify_failed is permanent because the greeting may already have been delivered.",
